    "clinical_disclaimers": {
      "decision_support_only": "All Paceful healthcare signals are decision-support tools for licensed clinicians and care teams. They are not diagnostic instruments and do not replace validated clinical screeners (PHQ-9, GAD-7, C-SSRS) administered under clinical supervision.",
      "no_crisis_detection": "This vertical pack does NOT include crisis detection (suicidal ideation, self-harm, acute psychiatric emergency). Platforms requiring crisis detection must use validated screeners with human clinical oversight. Paceful's 'Clinical Plus' pack for crisis signals will be released only after clinical advisor review.",
      "phi_handling": "Paceful does not store raw text. Only hashed references and numerical scores are persisted. Partners are responsible for HIPAA-compliant data handling on their side, including BAA execution."
